* Results by Gender: Displays race results filtered by gender and distance.
*   When to use:    After the race to review results by gender for each distance.
*   How to use:     Double-click to display the results in the Browse window.

* 5K Results
ResultsByGender.rsm M Finish 5k
ResultsByGender.rsm F Finish 5k

* 10K Results
ResultsByGender.rsm M Finish 10k
ResultsByGender.rsm F Finish 10k

* Examples for other events:
* ResultsByGender.rsm M Time 5k
* ResultsByGender.rsm F Time 5k